 Kubernetes Pod Creation
Problem: Create a pod named pod-httpd using the httpd:latest image with app label httpd_app, container name httpd-container.

Solution:

pod-httpd.yaml:

yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: pod-httpd
  labels:
    app: httpd_app
spec:
  containers:
    - name: httpd-container
      image: httpd:latest
      ports:
        - containerPort: 80
bash
kubectl apply -f pod-httpd.yaml
kubectl get pods
